  "system": {
    "identifier": "flashing-streaks",
    "description": "<p>You ready yourself to attack with your weapons at high speeds and attaching a Flash Tag to your ammunition. Make a ranged taijutsu attack targeting a creature you can see in range. On a hit, you deal your [Weapons damage] + 2d6. Regardless of a hit or miss, the affected creature, and all creatures within 10 feet of it, must make a Constitution saving throw as the Flash Tag detonates. On a failed save, affected creatures gain a rank of Dazzled.</p>\n<p>Chain 1: Increase the size of the affected flash range to 15 feet, making all creatures within 15 feet of the target creature make their saving throw vs jutsu effect.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For every rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost by 3 and the damage by 1d4.</p>",
